Gen 3:1 , The serpent deceives Eve;
Gen 3:6 , Both she and Adam transgress the divine command, and fall into sin and misery;
Gen 3:8 , God arraigns them;
Gen 3:14 , The serpent is cursed;
Gen 3:15 , The promised seed;
Gen 3:16 , The punishment of mankind;
Gen 3:21 , Their first clothing;
Gen 3:22 , Their expulsion from paradise.
